[00:18.82]1. “The signs of the times” prove God’s rule has begun.
[00:26.46]In glory enthroned sits Jehovah’s Son.
[00:32.96]The heavens are cleansed, Satan’s now debased,
[00:38.82]And soon on the earth let God’s will take place.
[00:47.64](Chorus)
[00:47.66]Rejoice! For God’s tent is with men,
[00:52.92]And he himself resides with them.
[01:00.54]No more will there be pain or worrying,
[01:06.32]No sting of death nor any sorrowing.
[01:12.68]For God has said: ‘I’m making all things new.’
[01:20.02]These words faithful are and true.
[01:45.92]2. Let all men the pure New Jerusalem see,
[01:52.38]The bride of the Lamb shining radiantly.
[01:59.18]Adorned for her husband in gems so bright,
[02:04.86]And only Jehovah will be her light.
[02:13.56](Chorus)
[02:13.58]Rejoice! For God’s tent is with men,
[02:18.98]And he himself resides with them.
[02:26.48]No more will there be pain or worrying,
[02:32.60]No sting of death nor any sorrowing.
[02:38.74]For God has said: ‘I’m making all things new.’
[02:45.92]These words faithful are and true.
[03:15.14]3. This city so grand will become a delight.
[03:21.86]Its gates will be open both day and night.
[03:27.74]The nations will walk in her glory bright;
[03:34.00]The servants of God now reflect that light.
[03:42.76](Chorus)
[03:42.76]Rejoice! For God’s tent is with men,
[03:48.10]And he himself resides with them.
[03:55.64]No more will there be pain or worrying,
[04:01.92]No sting of death nor any sorrowing.
[04:07.78]For God has said: ‘I’m making all things new.’
[04:16.84]These words faithful are and true.
